                <invention-title lang="de">AUFSATZ FÜR EIN ROBOTISCHES MEDIZINISCHES SYSTEM</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">FIXATION POUR SYSTÈME MÉDICAL ROBOTIQUE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ATTACHMENT FOR ROBOTIC MEDICAL SYSTEM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A robotic medical system, comprising: a positioning system coupled to a base, the positioning system including a substantially vertical post, the post including a receptacle provided at a top portion of the post; and a robotic drive having an attachment interface for engaging the receptacle of the post, wherein the receptacle includes a tapered interface, and the attachment interface includes a tapered hook configured to engage the tapered interface of the receptacle.</p>
            </abstract>
